  "explanation": "The pipeline starts with a Builder creating the core strategy framework, which is immediately enriched by a Gulf-specific Refiner to ensure local regulatory and cultural accuracy. An IF quality gate validates that all four required domains—partner selection, governance, format adaptation, and workforce localization—are thoroughly addressed, routing back to the Refiner if gaps are found. A domain Expert then injects deep knowledge on JV governance, ownership structures, and compliance. A Synthesis Refiner merges all inputs into a unified plan. A WHILE quality gate performs iterative final validation, looping back to the Synthesis Refiner up to three times until executive-grade coherence is achieved. Finally, the Polisher delivers a board-ready document."
